&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every mind is unique. Yet much of the world is still built for what’s considered &quot;normal,&quot; leaving too many people behind. At Everway, we change that by creating technology that helps everyone understand and be understood. By understanding and addressing the unique needs of each individual, we&#39;re creating a world where differences are recognized and valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our careers fit real life. When you join us, you’re not just taking a job. You’re joining a movement to build a more neuroinclusive world. We’re a global community of over 800 employees spanning North America, UK, Europe, Australia, and New Zealand. A career here is purposeful and fast-moving, with clear expectations, modern tools, and the clarity to focus on what matters most.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our people are supported and encouraged to show up as they are, with different ways of thinking welcomed and valued. We pride ourselves on our core values that are embedded within our culture. These are to &lt;strong&gt;be curious, have courage, and commit fully&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us at Everway - together, we can unlock the full potential of every mind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Salesforce Administrator (Service Cloud) to join our Information Systems team, responsible for the technical ownership, administration, and optimisation of our Salesforce based Service capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will play a critical part in ensuring our customer support systems (Service Cloud, Zendesk, Gainsight) are reliable, well-integrated, and enabling scalable revenue operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work within our Salesforce team, liaising closely with the data team, and business stakeholders across Renewals and Customer Success to ensure systems and integrations support end-to-end revenue processes and help optimise the tech stack to deliver tech efficiencies to the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CSM System Ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical SME for the customer support ecosystem, ensuring systems are scalable, secure, and aligned to business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the administration, configuration, and ongoing optimisation of Service tools (Salesforce Service Cloud, Zendesk, Gainsight).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integration &amp;amp; Data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and support integrations between Salesforce, CSM tools and other key business systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate data-flow issues and work with internal engineering teams or external partners to resolve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather requirements and contribute Salesforce expertise to integration design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process Enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support key processes with the CS teams to translate business requirements into system solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to automate manual processes and improve operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accurate and timely data flows between systems to support reporting and analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Data team to ensure Salesforce data is properly modelled and available in downstream systems (e.g. Databricks, BI tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Best Practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain standards for system configuration, documentation, and change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure appropriate access controls, compliance, and auditability across the Customer Support stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to overall enterprise architecture and systems strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Criteria&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on Salesforce administration experience using Service &amp;amp; Sales Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience configuring Salesforce Sales &amp;amp; Service Clouds, Flow, validation rules, permission sets, integrations, reports and dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting Customer Support teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of SaaS integrations and how data moves between Salesforce and connected systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate requirements from Sales, Customer Success and Finance into practical system improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting, documentation and stakeholder-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Zendesk and migrating users to Service Cloud&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an M&amp;amp;A, PE backed, high-growth SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Mulesoft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data platforms (e.g. Databricks, Snowflake) and data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please submit your application by &lt;strong&gt;Wednesday 9th December 2026.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: applications may close early due to high demand, so early submission is encouraged.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join our team and enjoy a competitive salary with bonus opportunities, flexible work schedules, and comprehensive health and wellness benefits. We offer flexible time off plans, career growth through development programs, and a collaborative, innovative culture where your ideas matter.&amp;nbsp; Ready to make an impact? Apply today and be part of a company that invests in your success!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to providing a Drug-Free Workplace for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can view our Recruitment and Selection Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1yDxHyVbhh8MK9NnCYdnEAfVSO4rhPCovVbKK8ecxT4U/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please click the link for our &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uAKvHVSRsqZ83CGhM3_3Dc6RPsXwlTdmwdUH7msHkVM/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Présentation du poste :&lt;/strong&gt; Au sein de l’équipe Data Analytics d&#39;Artefact, vous rejoignez un pôle clé couvrant le dashboarding, l&#39;analytics engineering, la mesure marketing et le low-code data science. Dans un environnement à forte croissance, vous intervenez auprès de grands comptes pour transformer leurs enjeux business grâce à une collecte, un traitement et une visualisation de données performants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce qu’on attend de vous :&lt;/strong&gt; En tant que profil Senior, vous garantissez l&#39;excellence technique et la qualité de la valeur livrée sur vos projets analytiques. Vous jouez un rôle de conseiller de confiance auprès des clients, tout en mentorant des profils plus juniors et en intégrant les derniers usages d&#39;IA Générative appliqués à l&#39;analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter la livraison de projets Analytics de bout en bout : du cadrage des cas d&#39;usage avec les équipes métier jusqu&#39;au déploiement de dashboards, pipelines et produits data décisionnels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et implémenter des architectures analytiques scalables en appliquant les pratiques modernes d&#39;Analytics Engineering (modélisation de données, tests, qualité de code).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exploiter les développements récents en GenAI pour maximiser la valeur délivrée à nos clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extraire des insights stratégiques et les restituer de manière claire et actionnable pour accompagner la prise de décision des parties prenantes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agir en expert référent auprès des clients : construire une relation de confiance et apporter des recommandations sur les meilleures pratiques d&#39;analyse de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorer les Data Analysts juniors, partager les meilleures pratiques (ateliers, documentation) et participer à la création d&#39;accélérateurs internes et à la veille technologique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience &amp;amp; Mindset :&lt;/strong&gt; 3 ans ou plus d&#39;expérience concrète dans un environnement data-driven, avec autonomie, rigueur et curiosité intellectuelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domaines d&#39;expertise (au moins 1) :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dashboarding &amp;amp; Dataviz (Power BI, Looker, Tableau, Superset)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics Engineering (dbt sur BigQuery, Snowflake, Databricks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing Analytics &amp;amp; Mesure (CDP, MMM, attribution, Clean Rooms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-Code / No-Code Data Science (Dataiku, Copilot Studio)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Socle Technique :&lt;/strong&gt; Solide maîtrise de SQL et Python, bases en Git et principes d&#39;ingénierie logicielle (versioning, tests), ainsi qu&#39;une expérience sur les environnements Cloud (GCP, Azure, AWS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posture &amp;amp; Communication :&lt;/strong&gt; Capacité avérée à faire le pont entre équipes techniques et métier, accompagnement des profils juniors et communication claire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Call :&lt;/strong&gt; Échange initial sur votre parcours, vos motivations et l&#39;adéquation culturelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Interview :&lt;/strong&gt; Évaluation approfondie de votre socle technique (SQL, Python, Cloud) et de vos expertises Analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Interview :&lt;/strong&gt; Mise en situation sur la résolution de cas d&#39;usage business et la restitution analytique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fit Interview :&lt;/strong&gt; Échange final de projection opérationnelle et de fit culturel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération :&lt;/strong&gt; Package : 53 000 € à 63 000 € brut annuel (fixe) + 5 000 € de variable, selon expérience et séniorité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Présentation entreprise&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact est un cabinet de conseil spécialisé en data et en intelligence artificielle, qui accompagne les entreprises pour transformer ces technologies en impact business concret et mesurable. A la croisée du conseil, de la data et de la technologie, nos 2 500 collaborateurs dans 27 pays mettent leurs expertises en commun pour concevoir, développer et déployer des solutions qui répondent aux enjeux de transformation de nos clients. Envie d&#39;en savoir plus? Découvrez Artefact, nos expertises et notre culture : &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.artefact.com/?utm_source=gemini&quot;&gt;https://www.artefact.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des perspectives fait la richesse de nos équipes. Nous nous engageons à offrir un environnement inclusif et des opportunités équitables, où chacune et chacun peut évoluer et exprimer pleinement son potentiel. Nos recrutements reposent sur les compétences, le potentiel et l&#39;adéquation avec le rôle.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt; At PHENOGY, we energize the future—sustainably. In this role&amp;nbsp;you will define and execute our digital engineering strategy, owning the architecture, security, quality, and lifecycle of our cloud, edge, and data products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Operating at the intersection of clean energy and industrial IoT, you will lead the digital ecosystem for our Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS) &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;148&quot;&gt;from the gateway upward&lt;/strong&gt;—connecting Edge/Gateway → Cloud Infrastructure → APIs → Monitoring/NOC → Customer Applications &amp;amp; Data Platforms. Working in close alignment with our Embedded Systems lead, Product, Cybersecurity, Operations, and Quality teams, you will turn complex energy and regulatory requirements into scalable, high-availability software and data platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You Will Own &amp;amp; Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Data Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define our technology roadmap, sourcing model (in-house vs. external), and application/data architecture. Establish clear boundaries, data models, APIs, and technical standards from the gateway layer through edge computing, cloud services, data pipelines, and customer/Battery Passport platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Engineering, DevOps &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead internal engineers and external partners. Govern the full software lifecycle—from requirements and Git workflows to automated CI/CD pipelines, environment segregation, release/rollback procedures, and end-of-life decommissioning. Champion automated testing (unit, integration, performance, regression) and proactively manage technical debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Cybersecurity &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Embed Security-by-Design via a Secure Software Development Lifecycle (SSDLC). Oversee secure coding, secrets/certificate management, SBOMs, open-source licensing, vulnerability remediation (SAST/DAST/SCA), and penetration testing across our edge and cloud stack in alignment with ISO/IEC 27001, IEC 62443, NIST SSDF, OWASP, NIS2, and the EU Cyber Resilience Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Connected Fleet &amp;amp; Data Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive high-throughput telemetry ingestion, operational data processing, analytics, remote diagnostics, gateway/edge over-the-air (OTA) updates, and secure remote access across our connected storage fleet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Embedded Interface Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the Embedded Systems lead (who owns BMS, controllers, and string-level firmware) to define clean gateway protocols and data contracts—ensuring seamless integration without overlapping responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Team &amp;amp; Supplier Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, mentor, and scale a high-performing platform and data engineering organization. Manage external development partners from technical due diligence and contracting through delivery, ensuring clean IP ownership, documentation, and zero single-vendor lock-in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Executive Governance &amp;amp; IT Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Hold decision-making authority over digital platform architecture, tech stacks, repositories, CI/CD, and technical debt. Partner closely with the Head of IT to maintain a clear boundary between product software and enterprise IT while jointly governing shared domains (IAM, cloud infrastructure, networking, incident response, and disaster recovery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Data Engineering, IT, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record leading software/data teams, complex engineering programs, and external development vendors, translating business goals into clear roadmaps and architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Modern Cloud, API &amp;amp; Data Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in cloud-native software architecture, data pipelines/telemetry processing, integration patterns, REST/streaming APIs, DevOps, CI/CD automation, and full-lifecycle release management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Security Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong command of secure software engineering practices, vulnerability management, and risk-based decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to bridge deep technical execution with executive stakeholder alignment—balancing speed, cost, quality, and operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;Domain experience in Energy Tech, BESS, Industrial IoT, Edge computing, or connected fleet platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;Hands-on familiarity with Microsoft Azure, Azure DevOps, C#/.NET, Python, modern data stacks, and REST APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of IEC 62443 and cybersecurity standards for connected industrial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot;&gt;Experience managing high-availability operational systems and formal product lifecycle management (PLM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;How Success Is Measured&lt;/strong&gt; You will have clear ownership backed by transparent engineering metrics, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Roadmap predictability, release frequency, deployment success/rollback rates, platform availability, and incident trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Code, Data &amp;amp; Security Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Automated test coverage, data pipeline reliability/latency, CI/CD maturity, defect rates/MTTR, critical vulnerability remediation speed, and technical debt reduction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Efficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Architecture documentation completeness, supplier delivery quality, and R&amp;amp;D resource efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Workload:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time | &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Senior Management / Head&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Executive Management (CTO / COO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Become part of our eco-passionate expert team - a first-class team all around.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Benefit from flexible work hours as well as remote and on-site working in a modern sustainable office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Enjoy various events, an amazing coffee machine, and the occasional coffee from our CEO (acting Barista)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;At PHENOGY, we highly value diversity, equality, and inclusion. It makes our company stronger. &lt;strong&gt;Our philosophy: one mindset, many minds.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
